  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep16 史上最难秋招，我和HR聊了聊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683d9f4b31215eb506edb429</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">683d9f4b31215eb506edb429</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Jun 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>大家好，我是方瑞，欢迎收听《毕业之后》。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期嘉宾：凉粉同学】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期简介】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目很高兴请到了小宇宙主播：凉粉同学。她在小宇宙的播客节目是《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65474b53e5a250ab410497c7" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65474b53e5a250ab410497c7"><span>万境随心</span></a><span>》，欢迎大家关注。</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为一名曾经的券商HR，凉粉在工作中是筛选简历的一方，而我们则是投递简历的一方。</span><strong><span>对每一届毕业生来说，当年的秋招都是“史上最难”，而最近几年尤甚</span></strong><span>。2025年秋招即将拉开大幕，我们不妨换个视角，一起来听听HR怎么说。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">04:50</a> 每个人成长道路上所谓的弯路究竟是不是一个“伪命题”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="412">06:52</a> 因为不喜欢工科和理科，所以选择了工商管理专业。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="672">11:12</a> 大学本科对我而言就是拿了一张文凭，对工作的帮助十分有限。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">17:53</a> 国内读研和出国读研，怎么选？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1331">22:11</a> </span><strong><span>HR怎么看待学历贬值现象？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1676">27:56</a> </span><strong><span>是不是所有的毕业生都要从世界500强开启自己的职业生涯？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1862">31:02</a> 广告、公关行业的日常工作是什么样的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2071">34:31</a> </span><strong><span>给明星拎包、提裙子都得论资排辈，不是你想提就提的。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2226">37:06</a> </span></strong><span>在猎头公司每天都做什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2501">41:41</a> 券商在招人时比较看重应聘者的哪些方面？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【背景音乐】</span></strong><span>Prelude in A major - Chopin</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>【联系我】</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>微信：Biye_10</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>邮箱：biye1995@163.com</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>【关注我】</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>微信公众号：毕业之后Podcast</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>小红书：毕业之后</span></em></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66c1b3ce8947ccb25427fc7a/lmqGunqItJAumiDoNgmEvkSy7nsP.m4a" length="46701089" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:04</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv_5zZS25KA_BfzSfRS4FOE35ArH.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Ep15 挂号看病如何避雷“董小姐”｜串台《时常帮助》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683327f7dce640bfddbf67a0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">683327f7dce640bfddbf67a0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 25 May 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>大家好，我是方瑞，欢迎收听《毕业之后》。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期嘉宾：马医生】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期简介】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目是串台《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/646aedeafc773067cc7da018" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/646aedeafc773067cc7da018"><span>时常帮助</span></a><span>》的下半期，嘉宾是资深肿瘤科医生：马医生。上半期节目我们聊的话题大都围绕学医，而在下半期节目中，我们聊的更多是走出校园后如何成长为一名专业又有温度的医生。此外，马医生也给大家分享了一些挂号就诊的小建议，希望能让大家少走弯路。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝愿各位听友和家人都能身体健康，平安顺遂。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 开始做医疗科普播客的契机。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="866">14:26</a> 作为嘉宾做客《无聊斋》，开启了我的播客初体验。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1451">24:11</a> 我的播客节目让患者更信任我，还能帮患者省钱。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1831">30:31</a> 短视频平台上不少所谓的“健康博主”其实是没有执业证书的非法行医，希望大家一定擦亮眼睛。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2188">36:28</a> 目前不少疾病都有规范的诊疗方案，</span><strong><span>在一线临床医生看来，老百姓是否还有必要执着于大城市的顶级三甲医院？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2666">44:26</a> 在工作中几乎每天都给病人开药，</span><strong><span>医生如何看药品集采，药效真的有很大区别吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2902">48:22</a> 副主任医师现身说法，教你如何挂号选医生。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3259">54:19</a> 看病前要做哪些准备才能更高效的和医生沟通，以便少走弯路。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3736">62:16</a> 善用AI和三甲医院的线上问诊平台，可以省去一些舟车劳顿，事半功倍。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4009">66:49</a> 作为医生，我并不担心自己的工作会被AI取代。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4228">70:28</a> 肿瘤科医生如何调节自己的心态，会不会觉得人类在疾病面前太过渺小，非常无力。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4560">76:00</a> 如何鉴别网络“健康博主”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【片头曲】Natrual Ability by 鹤The Crane</span></p><span></span><p><span>【背景音乐】Raindrops Never Stop Falling by Dennis Kuo</span></p><span></span><p><span>【片尾曲】男人也好女人也好</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>【联系我】</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>微信：Biye_10</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>邮箱：biye1995@163.com</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>【关注我】</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>微信公众号：毕业之后Podcast</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>小红书：毕业之后</span></em></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66c1b3ce8947ccb25427fc7a/liR0kcBMfpU3Ed9xMRlZdQs8m6tV.m4a" length="82737779" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:25:11</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrOZBQoagv6_xyG16glOSKaxl8Mm.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
