  <item>
    <title>Ep10 文、理科对谈，大家都不容易啊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671fa7d4db74c60aa4df82f8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671fa7d4db74c60aa4df82f8</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Oct 2024 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>大家好，我是方瑞，欢迎收听《毕业之后》。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期嘉宾：《</span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66a35a0d33ddcbb53c405cdf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66a35a0d33ddcbb53c405cdf"><span>边缘学生</span></a><strong><span>》的主播 盐酸和玻璃】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期简介】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目很高兴和《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66a35a0d33ddcbb53c405cdf" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66a35a0d33ddcbb53c405cdf"><span>边缘学生</span></a><span>》串台。</span></p><span></span><p><span>文理科对谈之后，我们才发现每个专业都是一座围城。无论学文，还是学理，都有各自的迷茫与困惑。而如今在</span><strong><span>秋招面前，更是众生平等，985也是零 offer</span></strong><span>。最后，还是要祝大家披荆斩棘，乘风破浪，都能找到理想的工作。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> 考败来厦，我因为高考发挥失常来到厦门大学。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">06:03</a> 在厦门和福州之外，泉州很低调，闷声发大财。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a> </span><strong><span>为什么说自己是“边缘学生”？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="567">09:27</a> 我的同学是因为家里的生意需要人管理，所以才来学工商管理专业。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> </span><strong><span>因为心中的新闻理想，我的第一志愿全部填了新闻传播学。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1147">19:07</a> </span><strong><span>秋招面前，人人平等。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1872">31:12</a> 现在大三的我，心中还有新闻理想吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a> 十八岁的我们对于一些“经验”都会不以为然。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2179">36:19</a> 文科生是如何看理科专业的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2510">41:50</a> 我讲一个暴论：只有985院校才应该开设工商管理专业。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2566">42:46</a> 全国前三的建筑学专业毕业，日常工作就是画车库和厕所。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3396">56:36</a> 现在大三，如果可以回到18岁，会修改自己的高考志愿吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【背景音乐：Our time】</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>【联系我】</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>微信：Biye_10</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>邮箱：biye1995@163.com</span></em></p>]]></description>
